  M85 section 7 reported 19-34 % at 74 cy/mm; this range CONTAINS it.

ANSWER TO THE SECOND ARM:
  The 74 cy/mm floor is not in the demosaic, the resample or the merge, because
  74 cy/mm is 1.51 x the Nyquist frequency of the plane those
  stages operate on. No stage downstream of the mosaic can represent it, so
  none of them can be the floor. It is lost at the point the product chooses
  to emit one pixel per 2x2 Bayer cell, and the optics still deliver 31-71 %
  MTF at the very edge of what is emitted.

